BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Street Dance Festival 'Cuerpo Romo' — Madrid
DTSTART;TZID="UTC+02:00":20261016T100000
DTEND;TZID="UTC+02:00":20261017T235900
DTSTAMP:20261017T203942Z
UID:505235b7cf6a72bcf02927dc9db3@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Multidisciplinary\,Madrid\,Spain
DESCRIPTION:This year’s line-up features performances (solos\, duets\, t
 rios\, etc.) by established and emerging choreographers\, family activitie
 s\, live music sessions with dancers\, improvisations\, and professional w
 orkshops\, among other activities. In addition to its usual outdoor stage 
 at Plaza Matadero \, this edition introduces two indoor shows at Nave 11 i
 n Centro Danza Matadero . Cuerpo Romo ("Blunt Body") refers to the wear an
 d tear of the body through contact with the ground. Dancing in an urban en
 vironment shapes a unique kind of dancer—one who adapts to the harshness
  of the asphalt\, rounding out like a pebble. Malleability is a defining f
 eature of contemporary dance\, essential for performing outdo\nCategory: M
 ultidisciplinary\nOriginal listing: https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/sche
 dule/street-dance-festival-cuerpo-romo
LOCATION:Plaza Matadero\, Plaza de Legazpi\, 8\, Madrid\, 28045
STATUS:CANCELLED
URL:https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/street-dance-festival-cuerp
 o-romo
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:europe
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:matadero-madrid
END:VEVENT
