DESCRIPTION:A sunny room on an upper floor is prime real estate in the Bri
 stol Place Senior Living Facility\, so when the cantankerous Abby is force
 d to share her quarters with new-arrival Marilyn\, she has no choice but t
 o get rid of the infuriatingly chipper woman by any means necessary. A see
 mingly harmless bet between the old women quickly escalates into a dangero
 us game of one-upmanship that reveals not just the tenacity of these worth
 y opponents\, but also deeper truths that each would rather remain hidden.
  “Tastily sweet-and-sour\, Ripcord is great fun!” – Time Out New Yor
 k\nCategory: Theater\nOriginal listing: https://www.artsatl.org/event/ripc
 ord/2026-10-16/
