SUMMARY:VHS Deathmatch: Dead on Arrival — Atlanta
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-04:00":20261016T203000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-04:00":20261016T223000
DTSTAMP:20261017T203942Z
UID:07b66041719e504f69aaeb7ec105@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Film + TV\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:Atlanta’s trash-cinema showdown returns from the dead. VHS D
 eathmatch pits two cult horror movies against each other in a live\, inter
 active battle: RETURN OF THE LIVING DEAD (1985) vs. NIGHT OF THE CREEPS (1
 986). We’re not showing the full movies. We’ve chopped them down to th
 eir wildest scenes — creatures\, practical effects\, ridiculous dialogue
 \, exploding heads and everything else worth arguing about. Between rounds
 \, our hosts and guests break down the madness\, roast what deserves roast
 ing and make their case. Then the audience votes to decide the winner. One
  movie survives. The other meets its maker. Friday\, October 16 at Wild He
 aven Beer – West End. Free admission with RSVP.\nCategory: Film + TV\nOr
 iginal listing: https://www.artsatl.org/event/vhs-deathmatch-dead-on-arriv
 al/
LOCATION:Wild Heaven West End Brewery &#038\; Gardens\, 1010 White St SW\,
  Atlanta\, 30310
STATUS:CANCELLED
URL:https://www.artsatl.org/event/vhs-deathmatch-dead-on-arrival/
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:us
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:artsatl
END:VEVENT
