 et Atlanta Every other Saturday… It’s time to pick a side! We’re tur
 ning The Lawn at Uptown into a music battlefield. Three DJs go head-to-hea
 d\, armed with the best tracks from three iconic eras. 🎧 With a flip of
  the switch\, tune into your favorite music. The color of your headphones 
 changes to indicate what you’re listening to. Look around and see which 
 DJ/Color is winning. 🟢 Green DJ – Today’s Hits: Pop\, K Pop\, Hip H
 op\, & Latin hits. 🔴 Red DJ – 90’s & 2K Throwbacks: Boy Bands\, Div
 as\, Punk\, Alternative. 🔵 Blue DJ – 70’s & 80’s Classics: Disco
 \, Funk\, Rock\, & New wave. Your DJ Contenders are: DJ Sayers | DJ Tuurnu
 up | DJ Blaq Mozart ⚔️ The\nCategory: Dance\nOriginal listing: https:/
