BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jazz Matters\, Inc. Icon Series Celebrates Keyboardist & Composer 
 Joe Sample — Atlanta
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-04:00":20261018T160000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-04:00":20261018T190000
DTSTAMP:20261017T203942Z
UID:f4668a3b31340625f7754afe9ebd@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Music\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the legacy of Joe Sample\, the legendary keyboardist
  and composer who co-founded the iconic Crusaders. Experience a night of m
 usical magic as we pay tribute to his extraordinary contributions to jazz 
 and beyond. Sample’s unparalleled artistry seamlessly blended genres\, t
 aking the Crusaders from hard bop to a unique funk style infused with R&B.
  As a trailblazer in the jazz-funk movement\, he shaped the evolution of T
 he Crusaders into a pioneering fusion group. On his own\, his performances
  on the acoustic piano were renowned for their lyrical phrasing and crysta
