DESCRIPTION:VIVA LAS AMÉRICAS | SHARED IDENTITY Who are we? Our 2026–27
  All Together Now journey begins with shared identity. The Americas are no
 t one people\, one culture\, or one tradition. They are many histories\, n
 ations\, communities\, rhythms\, and voices existing alongside one another
 . Viva las Américas celebrates the idea that coming together does not req
 uire us to surrender what makes us distinct. We can retain our own identit
 ies while discovering what we share. Many voices become one experience. Su
 nday\, October 18\, 2026 | 4:00 PM Church at Wieuca\, Atlanta Featuring mu
 sic by Moncayo\, Gershwin\, Rodrigo\, Ginastera\, and Márquez\, with pian
 ist Mengyuan Li\, guitarist John Huston\, and a guest conductor fro\nCateg
