 he upcoming exhibition Confluence: The Tina Freeman Collection of Photogra
 phs . They will learn how to operate a camera\, use peer review to gain mo
 re skills in photography\, as well as how to mat and frame their photograp
 hs. Students will also draw inspiration from the natural life found in the
