CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Solo Exhibition\,New Orleans\,United States
DESCRIPTION:Nic[o] Brierre Aziz: "Sweet Surrender" is the Haitian-New Orle
 anian artist’s first institutional solo exhibition\, and surveys a range
  of works in performance\, photography\, sculpture\, and installation crea
 ted over the last ten years. Whether turning to Southern antebellum histor
 y or contemporary art markets\, Aziz’s work interrogates the de/valuatio
 n of Black life and cultural heritage\, both exposing and subverting syste
 ms of cultural\, political\, and economic power.\nCategory: Solo Exhibitio
 n\nOriginal listing: https://www.cacno.org/programming/sugar
