BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Dynamic! – Funny scenes\, songs and games! — Atlanta
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261114T220000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261114T233000
DTSTAMP:20261017T203942Z
UID:d6bd12ba9c4057e4a0d9b6b1986c@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Theater\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:The Dynamic! is an improv show that thrives on chaos\, quick t
 hinking\, and whatever ideas the audience throws at the cast. Every scene
 \, game\, and musical moment is built in real time\, and the performers le
 an into the unexpected with a mix of confidence\, silliness\, and genuine 
 surprise. They know how to turn a wild suggestion or a joke that goes off 
 the rails into something even funnier\, and half the joy is watching them 
 navigate the mess together. The show moves fast\, the energy stays high\, 
 and no two nights ever feel the same. You help spark the fun\, and the cas
 t runs with it to create a comedy experience that feels alive\, loose\, an
 d completely in the moment.\nCategory: Theater\nOriginal listing: https://
 www.artsatl.org/event/the-dynamic-funny-scenes-songs-and-games-5/2026-11-1
 4/
LOCATION:Dynamic El Dorado\, 572 Edgewood Ave SE #116\, Atlanta\, 30312
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.artsatl.org/event/the-dynamic-funny-scenes-songs-and-games
 -5/2026-11-14/
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:us
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:artsatl
END:VEVENT
